1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,627
This is Carnot's theorem.

2
00:00:01,627 --> 00:00:08,671
No engine working between two temperatures can be more efficient than a reversible engine between the same temperatures.

3
00:00:08,671 --> 00:00:15,104
And all reversible engines between them have the same efficiency, whatever the working substance.

